---
output: svg
---
@startuml
' Inside a package, the dot pipeline writes the leaves A and B before the
' empty package P, so Graphviz lays out P, B, A from left to right. Smetana
' must receive the same order: in the reference SVG the title "P" has the
' smallest x, then "B", then "A".
!pragma layout smetana
package X {
  package P {
  }
  class A
  class B
}
@enduml
